# plugin/skills/ is generated from skills/ by scripts/sync-plugin-skills.sh,
# but it is COMMITTED, not ignored: the marketplace serves the plugin straight
# from the repository, so anything untracked here never reaches an installed
# plugin. Regenerate it with that script rather than editing it by hand.
